+RetreatUI v1.0.11-beta.21
+- Fixed Bloodmage Enraging Howl proc tracking by using the verified live aura name and spell ID 504157.
+- Enraging Howl now appears in the Bloodmage Procs/Buffs row with its remaining duration.
+- Retained the plural aura-name alias for compatibility without creating a duplicate tracker.
+
 RetreatUI v1.0.11-beta.20
 - Added native Auto Accept Role Checks automation without WeakAuras, minimap buttons or chat output.
 - Added Bloodmage Vanthir's Gift (1219817) to Procs/Buffs tracking.
